msgstr "幽灵会话"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:952
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hands the channel to somebody else. You keep operator status; they get everything that is founder-only, including this tab."
msgstr "把频道交给别人 您保留操作员状态; 他们得到的只是创建者, 包括这个标签 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:889
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How long someone must wait between joins, which is what stops a join flood. Zero turns it off."
msgstr "人们必须在接合之间等待多久, 也就是阻止接合的洪水。 零关."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:737
